Unsubscribed from Emails
###
People
###
Any rev01
###
People who selected to unsubscribe from emails between two dates 
###
en
###
-- requires automated log creation for flag changes to be enabled in Settings->Options->Logs 
VAR from DATE Opted out between$
$VAR to DATE and$

SELECT ownername, o.ID AS OID, ownercode, l.createddate, l.comments
FROM owner o
LEFT OUTER JOIN log l ON l.linkid = o.ID
WHERE l.createddate >= '$@from$' AND l.createddate <= '$@to$' 
AND l.createdby LIKE 'service' AND l.comments LIKE '%excludefrombulkemail%'
ORDER BY l.createddate
###
